msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫And that “the archangel Michael came to me in a vision” stuff! I never expected "
"you to go there."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Et le coup du « l’archange Michel est venu me visiter » ! Je n’aurais jamais cru "
