#: scenario8:scenario8_FE467025_F607_4DFF_AAAB_8B2043B0BA2F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1d0cf5d86d14b3ea93d5c1b1283e59b2483ea1f0bdfbe73bf9323873ff03a8eb
